<title>NORWAY: Technical snag stops trade at Oslo Bourse.</title>
<headline>Technical snag stops trade at Oslo Bourse.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in shares and bonds was disrupted at the Norwegian stock exchange on Tuesday because of technical problems, the bourse said in a statement at 0826 GMT.</p>
<p>It said derivatives trade continued as normal.</p>
<p>No further details were given.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
